\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My Father, for another night
\par Of quiet sleep and rest,
\par For all the joy of morning light
\par Thy holy name be blest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Now with the new- born day I give
\par Myself anew to Thee,
\par That as Thou willest I may live,
\par And what Thou willest be.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Whate'er I do, things great or small,
\par Whate'er I speak of frame,
\par Thy glory may I seek in all,
\par Do all in Jesu's name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. My Father, for His sake, I pray,
\par Thy child accept and bless;
\par And lead me by Thy grace to- day
\par In paths of righteousness.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

